== 7...b6 · Tartakower defence ==
7...b6 enters the '''Tartakower defence''', where Black hopes to develop the light-squared bishop. While it looks like Black intends to fianchetto the bishop, this isn't necessarily true. If White tries to blunt the a8-h1 diagonal immediately with '''8. cxd5''', Black will nonetheless be able to develop the bishop: 8. cxd5 Nxd5 9. Bxe7 Qxe7 10. Nxd5 exd5 {{Chess/not|=}} and Black can now put the bishop somewhere on the c8-h3 diagonal instead (usually going to e6).

