== 4...dxe5 · Larsen variation ==

Black initiates the trade of pawns. Consistent with 4. Nf3, recapturing with the knight, [[/5. Nxe5|'''5. Nxe5''']], is the preferred move. 

=== History ===

So named for [[w:Bent Larsen|Bent Larsen]] (1935―2010), who employed the line in the 1965 Candidates.<ref>[https://www.chessgames.com/perl/chessgame?gid=1061775 Ivkov v Larsen, 1965. Chessgames.com]</ref><ref>[https://www.chessgames.com/perl/chessgame?gid=1139722 Tal v Larsen, 1965. Chessgames.com]</ref><ref>[https://www.chessgames.com/perl/chessgame?gid=1139724 Tal v Larsen, 1965. Chessgames.com]</ref> 

