== 3. Bxa6 ==
White snap off Black's knight, thinking if 3...bxa6? they have ruined Black's pawn structure with doubled, isolated pawns on the a-file.

However, because Black has already opened up their queen with c6, they have the reply [[/3...Qa5|'''3...Qa5+''']] 4. Nc3 Qxa6, and Black picks up the bishop pair without spoiling their pawns. 

