== 5. Qh5 ==
White brings their queen out and checks Black's king. 

'''5...Ke7??''' would lose to a forced mate in 9 after 6. Qf7+, so Black has to find the surprising '''[[/5...g6|5...g6!?]]''', sacrificing the exchange after 6. Nxg6 hxg6 7. Qxh8, but after 7...Kf7! White's queen is trapped in the corner and White's bishop on c4 is still attacked.

