== 5. Qg4 ==
White brings out the queen and is ready to castle queenside quickly. White should try to make use of their piece activity while they still can. Meanwhile, Black should address the immediate threat of 6. Qxg7. They have two ways to do so.

'''[[/5...Nf6/]]''' is the main line. This gives up the g7-pawn, but Black will win the d4-pawn shortly thereafter.

'''[[/5...Qxd4/]]''' is the '''Kunin double gambit'''. Black takes the d4-pawn immediately and protects g7 in doing so. This does give White a lead in development in the process.

