=Winckelmann-Reimer Gambit=
White offers Black an exchange of pawns. Instead of accepting the gambit with [[/6...exf3/]] and allowing White to develop, Black should strike back with [[/6...c5/]], giving White the option to achieve tripled pawns on the c-file.

[[/6...b6/]], [[/6...Bd7/]], [[/6...e5/]] are also playable.

