== 9. Qxh7 ==
White's queen steps out of the way of the rook and takes a pawn along the way.

Having given up their kingside, Black should keep playing actively and accurately to capitalize off of the fact that White has spent the past three moves moving their queen. '''[[/9...cxd4|9...cxd4!]]''' is the best way to achieve this. Black regains one of their lost pawns and threatens 10...Qxc3+, which would pick up the rook. This also removes the only defender of the e5-pawn, making 10...Qxe5+ possible too.

