The opening was named after [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Wade_(chess_player) Robert Wade], who was the first to employ it, doing so 1953 against [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enrico_Paoli Enrico Paoli].<ref>{{cite web
