|access-date=20 October 2026
}}</ref> Wade would play it for a few more games, until it got widespread use starting in 1955. Since then, it has been used by some of the strongest players in the world, including Anatoly Karpov, Yasser Seirawan and Levon Aronian.<ref>{{cite web
